itle=\"Will save\">Will save</a> negates this effect.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Entangling_Yarn#Entangling_Yarn\" title=\"Entangling Yarn\"> Entangling Yarn</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Entangling_Yarn#Entangling_Yarn\" title=\"Entangling Yarn\"> Entangling Yarn</a>:</b> Enemies struck by this weapon have a small chance to be tangled up in its enchanted yarn, becoming <a href=\"/page/Entangled\" title=\"Entangled\">Entangled</a> and preventing all movement for 9 seconds. A DC 35 Reflex Save negates this effect.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Impactful\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Impactful\">Impactful 2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Impactful\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Impactful\">Impactful 2</a></b>: This effect causes the edges of this weapon to ripple with force, dealing 2 to 12 force on each hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning 2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" 